{
  "id": 442325755,
  "iid": 22894,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Epan: fix offset and length of CBOR bitmask fields",
  "description": "Fixes incorrect offsets/lengths for CBOR bitmask fields in TShark `-T jsonraw`.\n\nThis patch removes the use of a virtual child tvb in\n`proto_tree_add_cbor_bitmask()` and anchors both the parent bitmask\nitem and its boolean children to the actual CBOR-encoded integer bytes\nusing `chunk->start` and `chunk->head_length`.\n\nDecoding semantics and display filters are unchanged. Verified with tshark filters and jsonraw output before/after.\n\nFixes: #20918",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T13:07:16.351Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-12-25T19:15:07.505Z",
